 * Credit and licence terms: ATTRIBUTIONS.md. Acquisition, revisions, derivation and
 * known gaps: data/i18n/SOURCES.md.
 *
 * English covers every family. A locale is present only where the source carries a
 * category label for that family; a missing locale makes the public lookup return null.
 */
